On my MD-9600 I have noticed that it can stop on a repeater with TS1 traffic even if the channel is TS2 when scanning.<br>The audio is distorted and if you then stop on the channel and poke TS or channel a bit the distorted audio will cease.<br><br>Haven't verified what happens if I don't scan and stay on the same channel as the activity is so low , especially on TS1 here.<br>But I'm pretty sure it only happens during scan.<br><br>I think I noticed it on RT3S too but it needs to verified.<br><br>( Not sure if the thread creator have noticed similar TS bleed over.)<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2867">SA0BUX</a> — Fri Jun 16, 2023 11:08 pm</p><hr />
